WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.133 --> 00:00:05.872
A BRAZEN AND VIOLENT ASSAULT,
PAUL PELOSI, THE HUSBAND OF

00:00:05.872 --> 00:00:08.575
HOUSE SPEAKER NANCY PELOSI,
BRUTALIZED IN THEIR HOME.

00:00:08.575 --> 00:00:11.478
THE POLICE SAY THIS ATTACK
HAPPENED OVERNIGHT AFTER THE MAN

00:00:11.478 --> 00:00:13.546
BROKE IN.
THE SPEAKER WAS IN WASHINGTON.

00:00:13.546 --> 00:00:17.550
HER 82-YEAR-OLD HUSBAND IS IN
THE HOSPITAL, THE SPEAKER'S

00:00:17.550 --> 00:00:20.220
OFFICE SAYS TO MAKE A FULL
RECOVERY.

00:00:20.220 --> 00:00:24.057
A POLICE BRIEFING IS SCHEDULED
FOR THIS HOUR.

00:00:24.057 --> 00:00:26.626
AT THIS MOMENT WE'RE TRYING TO
FILL IN THE BIG QUESTION, WHAT

00:00:26.626 --> 00:00:35.001
WAS THE MOTIVE?
THE MALE SUSPECT IS IN CUSTODY.

00:00:35.001 --> 00:00:38.471
SOURCES TELLING CNN THE AS
ASSAILANT USED A HAMMER TO BEAT

00:00:38.471 --> 00:00:39.606
MR. PELOSI.
WE'RE JOINED WITH IMPORTANT

00:00:39.606 --> 00:00:43.409
BREAKING NEWS.
WHAT CAN YOU TELL US?

00:00:43.409 --> 00:00:51.117
&gt;&gt; Reporter: JOHN, IT APPEARS WE
MAY ACTUALLY HAVE THE MOTIVE OR

00:00:51.117 --> 00:00:53.453
PART OF THE MOTIVE.
I WAS TOLD BY A SOURCE BRIEFED

00:00:53.453 --> 00:01:01.161
ON THE ATTACK THAT THE ASSAY
LAPT WHO TALKED PAUL PELOSI WAS

00:01:01.161 --> 00:01:03.463
ACTU
ACTUALLY IN SEARCH FOR SPEAKER

00:01:03.463 --> 00:01:06.533
OF THE HOUSE, NANCY PELOSI.
THAT BEFORE THE ASSAULT

00:01:06.533 --> 00:01:17.210
OCCURRED, IN OTHER WORDS, BEFORE
HE ATTACKED PELOSI, THE INTRUDER

00:01:17.210 --> 00:01:22.048
CONFRONTED HIM SAYING, WHERE IS
NANCY, WHERE IS NANCY?

00:01:22.048 --> 00:01:26.286
JOHN, THIS IS FROM A SOURCE WHO
WAS BRIEFED ON THE ATTACK, WHO

00:01:26.286 --> 00:01:33.459
SAYS BEFORE HE PHYSICALLY
ASSAULTED THE SPEAKER'S HUSBAND,

00:01:33.459 --> 00:01:37.063
HE WAS CLEARLY LOOKING FOR
PELOSI HERSELF.

00:01:37.063 --> 00:01:42.168
QUOTE, WHERE IS NANCY?
WHERE IS NANCY?

00:01:42.168 --> 00:01:45.205
JOHN?
&gt;&gt; JAMIE GANGEL JOINING US.

00:01:45.205 --> 00:01:48.408
I WANT TO BRING IN EN PEREZ.
YOU'VE BEEN TRACKING WHAT POLICE

00:01:48.408 --> 00:01:51.110
ARE LEARNING.
WHAT MORE CAN YOU TELL US ABOUT

00:01:51.110 --> 00:01:53.346
THIS INVESTIGATION AND ABOUT
THIS BRAZEN, VIOLENT ASSAULT?

00:01:53.346 --> 00:01:58.051
&gt;&gt; JOHN, WE KNOW NOW THAT THE
FBI IS STILL AT THE SCENE THERE

00:01:58.051 --> 00:02:00.453
AT THE PELOSI HOME IN SAN
FRANCISCO.

00:02:00.453 --> 00:02:03.656
OF COURSE, THIS HAPPENED IN THE
EARLY MORNING HOURS.

00:02:03.656 --> 00:02:06.859
IF THE SPEAKER HAD BEEN THERE,
THERE WOULD HAVE BEEN A SECURITY

00:02:06.859 --> 00:02:08.394
DETAIL FROM THE U.S. CAPITOL
POLICE.

00:02:08.394 --> 00:02:13.132
THEY WERE NOT THERE BECAUSE SHE
IS NOT -- SHE WAS NOT AT HOME.

00:02:13.132 --> 00:02:17.303
THEY GOT THERE VERY QUICKLY.
AND NOW WE'RE TOLD THAT THIS IS

00:02:17.303 --> 00:02:20.073
AN INVESTIGATION BEING DONE
JOINTLY BY THE FBI WITH THE

00:02:20.073 --> 00:02:22.242
CAPITOL POLICE AND THE SAN
FRANCISCO POLICE DEPARTMENT.

00:02:22.242 --> 00:02:28.781
OF COURSE, THE BIG QUESTION THAT
I THINK JAMIE IS BEGINNING TO

00:02:28.781 --> 00:02:33.987
HELP ANSWER IS WHY THE FBI WOULD
BE INVOLVED AND THIS, PERHAPS,

00:02:33.987 --> 00:02:37.724
MIGHT EXPLAIN IT.
IF THE ASSAILANT WAS TRYING TO

00:02:37.724 --> 00:02:42.528
CARRY OUT THIS ATTACK IN SEARCH
OF THE SPEAKER, IF THERE WAS

00:02:42.528 --> 00:02:44.631
SOME KIND OF POLITICAL
MOTIVATION, PERHAPS, THOSE WOULD

00:02:44.631 --> 00:02:49.569
BE THE REASONS WHY THE FBI WOULD
BE PLAYING A BIG ROLE IN THIS

00:02:49.569 --> 00:02:52.071
INVESTIGATION.
AGAIN, WE'RE EXPECTING TO HEAR A

00:02:52.071 --> 00:02:56.342
LOT MORE FROM THE POLICE AT THIS
BRIEFING IN -- LATER THIS HOUR.

00:02:56.342 --> 00:02:59.445
IT DOES BEGIN TO SORT OF HELP
ANSWER THE QUESTIONS.

00:02:59.445 --> 00:03:00.780
THEY KNOW WHO CARRIED OUT THIS
ATTACK.

00:03:00.780 --> 00:03:03.316
THEY'RE DOING THEIR
INVESTIGATION.

00:03:03.316 --> 00:03:07.854
AND THEY'RE GETTING A SENSE OF
WHAT BROUGHT HIM -- THIS PERSON

00:03:07.854 --> 00:03:11.957
TO THE HOME.
IT IS A MALE PERSON WHO WAS

00:03:11.957 --> 00:03:14.961
ARRESTED THERE OR DETAINED BY
THE POLICE.

00:03:14.961 --> 00:03:17.797
STILL A LOT OF QUESTIONS AS TO
HOW HE GOT INTO THE HOUSE.

00:03:17.797 --> 00:03:21.267
IT APPEARS THAT HE CAME IN
THROUGH THE BACK OF THE

00:03:21.267 --> 00:03:25.772
RESIDENCE AND THEN CARRIED OUT
THIS ATTACK.

00:03:25.772 --> 00:03:27.606
A LOT OF VERY IMPORTANT
QUESTIONS STILL AS TO WHAT

00:03:27.606 --> 00:03:29.976
BROUGHT HIM TO THAT LOCATION,
JOHN.

00:03:29.976 --> 00:03:33.980
&gt;&gt; EVAN, STAND BY AS WELL, I
WANT TO CIRCLE BACK TO JAMIE

00:03:33.980 --> 00:03:36.049
GANGEL.
EVAN MAKES A KEY POINT THAT HAD

00:03:36.049 --> 00:03:39.185
THE SPEAKER BEEN HOME IN SAN
FRANCISCO, THERE WOULD HAVE BEEN

00:03:39.185 --> 00:03:43.289
A CAPITOL SECURITY POLICE DETAIL
THERE BECAUSE THAT'S

00:03:43.289 --> 00:03:46.092
REPRESENTATIVE FOR THE SPEAKER
OF THE HOUSE AND THE FBI ON THE

00:03:46.092 --> 00:03:51.998
SCENE SIGNALS THIS IS NOT JUST A
SAN FRANCISCO POLICE

00:03:51.998 --> 00:03:53.466
INVESTIGATION.
SO YOU CAN PROVIDE ANY

00:03:53.466 --> 00:03:55.268
ADDITIONAL DETAILS, I WANT TO
CIRCLE BACK.

00:03:55.268 --> 00:03:58.438
YOU SAY YOU'VE BEEN BRIEFED BY
SOMEBODY FAMILIAR WITH THE EARLY

00:03:58.438 --> 00:04:02.675
STAGE OF THIS INVESTIGATION.
SHARE MORE.

00:04:02.675 --> 00:04:05.678
&gt;&gt; Reporter: JOHN, WE HAVE ALL
BEEN CONCERNED ABOUT VIOLENCE

00:04:05.678 --> 00:04:11.417
AND THREATS RELATED TO POLITICS.
WE DON'T KNOW YET WHAT THE

00:04:11.417 --> 00:04:15.421
COMPLETE MOTIVE IS HERE, BUT
I'VE JUST BEEN TOLD FROM A

00:04:15.421 --> 00:04:20.360
SOURCE WHO WAS BRIEFED ON THE
ATTACK THAT THE ASSAILANT WHO

00:04:20.360 --> 00:04:23.796
ATTACKED PAUL PELOSI, THE
SPEAKER'S HUSBAND, WAS IN SEARCH

00:04:23.796 --> 00:04:27.767
FOR THE SPEAKER OF THE HOUSE.
THAT BEFORE THE ASSAULT

00:04:27.767 --> 00:04:34.040
OCCURRED, BEFORE HE PHYSICALLY
STARTED ATTACKING PAUL PELOSI,

00:04:34.040 --> 00:04:38.945
THAT HE CAME INTO THE HOME
SHOUTING, QUOTE, WHERE IS NANCY?

00:04:38.945 --> 00:04:46.619
WHERE IS NANCY?
SO, THERE DOES SEEM TO BE SOME

00:04:46.619 --> 00:04:50.423
INDICATION THAT, YOU KNOW,
WHETHER THIS WAS POLITICALLY

00:04:50.423 --> 00:04:56.662
MOTIVATED, YOU KNOW, AND WHAT
THE POLITICS MIGHT HAVE BEEN,

00:04:56.662 --> 00:04:59.765
THOSE ARE STILL QUESTIONS TO BE
ANSWERED, BUT IT DOES CERTAINLY

00:04:59.765 --> 00:05:04.303
SOUND LIKE HE WAS LOOKING FOR
THE SPEAKER OF THE HOUSE.

00:05:04.303 --> 00:05:05.738
JOHN?
&gt;&gt; JAMIE GANGEL, THANK YOU FOR

00:05:05.738 --> 00:05:09.742
THE BREAKING NEWS REPORT.
EVAN PEREZ, TO COME BACK TO YOU,

00:05:09.742 --> 00:05:13.212
TO THE POINT YOU JUST MADE.
LET'S ELABORATE TO MAKE CLEAR.

00:05:13.212 --> 00:05:16.849
FEDERAL INVOLVEMENT, THIS IS A
VERY DIFFERENT INVESTIGATION, A

00:05:16.849 --> 00:05:20.353
VERY DIFFERENT FOCUS.
IF YOU'RE TALKING ABOUT A

00:05:20.353 --> 00:05:24.790
BREAK-IN ON A HIGH-PROFILE HOME,
AIMED AT PAUL PELOSI OR A RANDOM

00:05:24.790 --> 00:05:28.428
BREAK-IN VERSUS IF THE FBI IS
GETTING CLUES TO BACK UP JAMIE'S

00:05:28.428 --> 00:05:30.830
REPORTING THAT THIS WAS A
TARGETED ATTACK ON THE SPEAKER

00:05:30.830 --> 00:05:33.366
OF THE HOUSE OF REPRESENTATIVES.
&gt;&gt; EXACTLY, JOHN.

00:05:33.366 --> 00:05:37.003
THE FACT WE SEE THE FBI, THEY'RE
STILL THERE, BY THE WAY, TELLS

00:05:37.003 --> 00:05:40.173
US THEY'RE GOING TO PLAY A BIG
ROLE IN THIS INVESTIGATION.

00:05:40.173 --> 00:05:46.212
THEY DON'T NORMALLY DO THIS ON
JUST AN ASSAULT ON A RANDOM HOME

00:05:46.212 --> 00:05:48.481
OR EVEN IF IT'S SOME RANDOM
ATTACK.

00:05:48.481 --> 00:05:54.053
THERE HAS TO BE SOME EVIDENCE
THEY'VE GOTTEN FROM THE EARLY

00:05:54.053 --> 00:06:01.561
PARTS OF THIS INVESTIGATION THAT
INDICATES THEY HAVE SOME KIND OF

00:06:01.561 --> 00:06:03.896
JURIS
JURISDICTION, SOME FEDERAL N

00:06:03.896 --> 00:06:06.466
NEXUS.
AS JAMIE JUST SAID, THERE'S BEEN

00:06:06.466 --> 00:06:12.305
CONCERN BY THE FBI, BY THE
JUSTICE DEPARTMENT ABOUT THREATS

00:06:12.305 --> 00:06:14.307
TO POLITICAL FIGURES IN THIS
COUNTRY.

00:06:14.307 --> 00:06:16.709
WE'VE SEEN AN ATTEMPTED
ASSASSINATION OF A SUPREME COURT

00:06:16.709 --> 00:06:20.413
JUSTICE IN THE LAST FEW MONTHS.
WE'VE SEEN CONCERNS FROM THE

00:06:20.413 --> 00:06:23.449
JUSTICE DEPARTMENT TO THREATS AT
PUBLIC OFFICIALS AT SCHOOL

00:06:23.449 --> 00:06:26.385
BOARDS, SO ON.
THERE'S BEEN THIS SORT OF

00:06:26.385 --> 00:06:29.255
ATMOSPHERE THAT THE FBI HAS BEEN
VERY MUCH CONCERNED ABOUT THE

00:06:29.255 --> 00:06:34.894
TONE OF SOME OF THE RHETORIC
THAT IS DRIVING SOME OF THIS AND

00:06:34.894 --> 00:06:37.830
SO, AGAIN, THAT'S THE BACK DROP
OF WHY THE FBI IS THERE, WHY

00:06:37.830 --> 00:06:41.767
THEY'RE THERE VERY QUICKLY AND
WHY THEY'RE NOW PLAYING A MAJOR

00:06:41.767 --> 00:06:44.003
ROLE IN THIS INVESTIGATION.
WE'LL LEARN MORE, OF COURSE,

00:06:44.003 --> 00:06:49.342
FROM POLICE WHEN THEY GIVE THIS
BRIEFING, BUT KEEP IN MIND, THE

00:06:49.342 --> 00:06:53.212
SPEAKER OF THE HOUSE TRAVELING
WITH A SECURITY DETAIL.

00:06:53.212 --> 00:06:55.814
THE CAPITOL POLICE GOT THERE
VERY QUICKLY BECAUSE THEY ARE

00:06:55.814 --> 00:07:02.588
PRESENT IN SAN FRANCISCO JUST
FOR WHEN SHE TRAVELS TO THAT

00:07:02.588 --> 00:07:04.590
LOCATION.
IT IS ONE OF THOSE THINGS, THE

00:07:04.590 --> 00:07:08.494
THREATS AGAINST PUBLIC OFFICIALS
IS RISING.

00:07:08.494 --> 00:07:14.667
IT IS A BIG CONCERN FOR THE FBI.
&gt;&gt; EVAN PEREZ, GRATEFUL AS WELL.

00:07:14.667 --> 00:07:17.670
LET'S CONTINUE THE COVERAGE.
THE WHITE HOUSE SAYS PRESIDENT

00:07:17.670 --> 00:07:20.740
BIDEN CALLED SPEAKER PELOSI TO
SHARE HIS OUTRAGE AT THE ATTACK

00:07:20.740 --> 00:07:23.309
AND VOICE HIS SUPPORT NOW AS HER
HUSBAND IS HOSPITALIZED.

00:07:23.309 --> 00:07:28.314
THE SPEAKER'S OFFICE BELIEVES
HE'LL MAKE A COMPLETE RECOVERY.

00:07:28.314 --> 00:07:31.617
MANU RAJU IS HERE WITH ME IN
STUDIO.

00:07:31.617 --> 00:07:34.220
FOR MORE ON WHAT WE KNOW AND THE
STUNNED REACTION HERE IN

00:07:34.220 --> 00:07:36.055
WASHINGTON.
&gt;&gt; WE KNOW -- WE'RE LEARNING A

00:07:36.055 --> 00:07:38.224
LITTLE MORE PIECE BY PIECE
THROUGH THE COURSE OF THIS

00:07:38.224 --> 00:07:41.527
MORNING.
WE DO KNOW THIS INDIVIDUAL WHEN

00:07:41.527 --> 00:07:44.463
HE BROKE INTO THE PELOSI HOME,
IT HAPPENED IN THE MIDDLE OF THE

00:07:44.463 --> 00:07:47.133
NIGHT, 2:27 A.M., ACCORDING TO
THE SAN FRANCISCO POLICE, CAME

00:07:47.133 --> 00:07:51.804
IN THROUGH THE BACK DOOR OF THE
HOUSE AND HAD A HAMMER IN HIS

00:07:51.804 --> 00:07:58.644
HAND, GOING INTO THE PELOSI
HOUSE, ATTACKED MR. PELOSI WITH

00:07:58.644 --> 00:08:02.415
A HAMMER, WAS SUPPOSEDLY TAKEN
TO THE HOSPITAL.

00:08:02.415 --> 00:08:05.685
MR. PELOSI, QUOTE, IS EXPECTED
TO MAKE A FULL RECOVERY AND

00:08:05.685 --> 00:08:06.852
RECEIVING EXCELLENT MEDICAL
CARE.

00:08:06.852 --> 00:08:09.188
WE'RE LEARNING MONTH ARE ABOUT
THAT.

00:08:09.188 --> 00:08:13.192
IT'S SO KEY TO POINT OUT ABOUT
THE SECURITY DETAIL AND THE

00:08:13.192 --> 00:08:16.062
SECURITY SITUATION ITSELF
BECAUSE SHE TRAVELS WITH U.S.

00:08:16.062 --> 00:08:19.265
CAPITOL POLICE BUT IT DOES NOT
EXTEND TO THE FAMILY MEMBERS

00:08:19.265 --> 00:08:21.266
THEMSELVES.
WE HAVE SEEN THROUGH THE COURSE

00:08:21.266 --> 00:08:24.437
OF THIS LAST COUPLE OF YEARS,
ALL THIS POLITICAL VIOLENCE

00:08:24.437 --> 00:08:26.138
DIRECTED TOWARDS MEMBERS OF
CONGRATULATIONS WHO HAVE HAD TO

00:08:26.138 --> 00:08:29.041
BOOST THEIR OWN SECURITY.
THEY'RE NOT PROVIDED SECURITY AS

00:08:29.041 --> 00:08:33.346
WELL, BUT THEY ARE ALLOWED TO
SPEND FEDERAL DOLLARS TO ENHANCE

00:08:33.346 --> 00:08:34.680
SECURITY.
THAT'S A NEW DEVELOPMENT BECAUSE

00:08:34.680 --> 00:08:37.450
OF THE RISE OF THREATS NOW THAT
WE'RE SEEING ALSO AGAINST FAMILY

00:08:37.450 --> 00:08:39.318
MEMBERS THEMSELVES.

